1Ki 19:1 , Elijah, threatened by Jezebel, flees to Beer-sheba;
1Ki 19:4 , In the wilderness, being weary of his life, he is comforted by an angel;
1Ki 19:9 , At Horeb God appears unto him, sending him to anoint Hazael, Jehu, and Elisha;
1Ki 19:19 , Elisha, taking leave of his friends, follows Elijah.
